                        "entry_id": "d5e5003b-3fab-3f67-801e-1f97aaaa44db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Peur des clowns."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a27eefe-6f02-41b8-b9a7-e6b1f729b874",
                                "sense_id": "52937db2-d7a8-3d22-84ef-aabeba9bf9c7",
                                "text": "Il s’est ensuite avéré au cours de l’enquête de police que ce dingue en était en fait vraiment un, puisqu’il s'agissait d’un jeune atteint de coulrophobie, la phobie des clowns."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d6e9850e-5969-4384-a769-f0113e98d1ac",
                        "source_entry_id": "d5e5003b-3fab-3f67-801e-1f97aaaa44db",
                        "source_sense_id": "52937db2-d7a8-3d22-84ef-aabeba9bf9c7",
                        "target_lang_word": "coulrophobia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "coulrophobia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ec80245-8195-3bb0-8b34-01c5b63d79ab",
                                        "entry_id": "bf2aed89-8a1d-3c9d-8cc3-cb52fa66a443",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fear of clowns."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "233ea831-e6a5-40ee-9c58-c5811cb9ee0e",
                                                "sense_id": "1ec80245-8195-3bb0-8b34-01c5b63d79ab",
                                                "text": "[…] to develop coulrophobia. On the seventh, clowns from around the world […] congregate at London's Holy Trinity Church for the annual Grimaldi Memorial Service."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6a50866-d6a0-4d9b-85d7-5f5e047bb3da",
                                                "sense_id": "1ec80245-8195-3bb0-8b34-01c5b63d79ab",
                                                "text": "Clowns are no laughing matter to Sean \"Puffy\" Combs. The swaggering rap royal is widely reported to suffer from coulrophobia, an irrational fear of the red-nosed, versized-shoe-wearing, greasepainted circus buffoons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58a89412-77f9-416c-93f5-2e01ccc3e35d",
                                                "sense_id": "1ec80245-8195-3bb0-8b34-01c5b63d79ab",
                                                "text": "⁵Unfortunately, the first time they attempted the study, the clown accidentally burst one of the balloons. The noise frightened the children and they associated that fear response with the clown. All 15 children are currently in therapy for coulrophobia!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01533859-2be5-4309-a169-ebf3a72d1d34",
                                                "sense_id": "1ec80245-8195-3bb0-8b34-01c5b63d79ab",
                                                "text": "After you plug in your wish list and dating criteria, search results spit out matches; it’s like scanning a room of a thousand and pinpointing the ten who share your favorite author and chronic coulrophobia (fear of clowns)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57a025a7-e806-4664-8f5b-eff9450f2964",
                                                "sense_id": "1ec80245-8195-3bb0-8b34-01c5b63d79ab",
                                                "text": "The ironic twist is that he recently admitted to a possible onset of coulrophobia."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
